<view class="jg-page jg-safe-bottom jg-enter-fwd">
  <jg-page-head
    title="开发者安全初始化"
    meta="仅用于系统首次建立最高权限账号。"
  />

  <view class="jg-note jg-note-warn jg-mt-0 jg-mb-12">
    <view>
      <view class="jg-note-t">安全说明</view>
      <view class="jg-note-m">初始化码只能配置在云函数环境变量中。普通登录不会调用此功能，也不得向普通用户提供入口。使用完成后请立即删除环境变量并重新部署云函数。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="jg-band jg-stagger jg-stagger-0">
    <view class="jg-band-head">
      <view class="jg-band-title-wrap">
        <text class="jg-band-idx">01</text>
        <text class="jg-band-title">初始化凭据</text>
      </view>
      <text class="jg-band-meta">一次性</text>
    </view>
    <view class="jg-card">
      <view class="jg-field-row jg-mt-0">
        <view class="jg-field-label">一次性初始化码</view>
        <view class="jg-field-body">
          <input class="jg-input jg-mono" password value="{{bootstrapCode}}" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="请输入云函数环境中的初始化码" />
        </view>
      </view>

      <button class="jg-btn jg-btn-accent jg-btn-block jg-mt-12" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting || !bootstrapCode}}" bindtap="handleSubmit">建立首个开发者账号</button>

      <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="jg-state-err jg-mt-12 jg-shake">
        <view class="jg-state-err-t">初始化失败</view>
        <view class="jg-state-err-m">{{error}}</view>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="jg-note jg-mt-12">
        <view>
          <view class="jg-note-t">初始化成功</view>
          <view class="jg-note-m">{{message}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
